    "comment": [
      "QCoro is built from source on Windows, by tools/windows/install-qcoro.ps1,",
      "which the Actions runner and a local checkout both call. The prefix name",
      "is part of the pin: it is what common.ps1 looks for and what the runner",
      "caches."
