  "shaderTools": {
    "comment": [
      "libplacebo needs a GLSL compiler for both its Vulkan and D3D11 backends,",
      "and SPIRV-Cross to reach HLSL for the latter. Linux gets both from nixpkgs;",
      "Windows has neither, and Meson's WrapDB carries no glslang or shaderc, so",
      "they are built from source there the way FFmpeg already is.",
      "The Vulkan headers come too: libplacebo has its own under 3rdparty but does",
      "not hand them to whoever links against it, and mpv includes its vulkan.h.",
      "None of this is the Vulkan SDK, and no loader is among it -- nothing here",
      "calls a Vulkan entry point, it only passes handles through."
    ],
    "version": "vulkan-sdk-1.4.357.0",
